## 🔒 Security & Best Practices

### Never Expose Credentials

**❌ NEVER include in code or responses:**
- TBO API credentials (`TBOH_API_USERNAME`, `TBOH_API_PASSWORD`)
- Production BookingIds or customer data
- Real payment information
- WordPress nonces in logs

**✅ ALWAYS:**
- Use environment variables from `.env`
- Use placeholders in documentation: `{{TBOH_API_USERNAME}}`
- Test in development environment only
- No secrets in repository

### Security Checklist
- ✅ Credentials in `.env` (never committed)
- ✅ `.env` listed in `.gitignore`
- ✅ `WP_DEBUG` only in development
- ✅ HTTPS in production
- ✅ Rotate credentials if exposed
- ✅ Payment integrations: use tokenization (never store CVV/cards)

