## 🐛 Debugging

### Log Locations

```bash
# WordPress debug log
tail -f wp-content/debug.log

# Filter specific components
grep "BookingSession" wp-content/debug.log
grep "TBO" wp-content/debug.log
grep "MyEndpoint" wp-content/debug.log
```

**Enable logging in `wp-config.php`:**
```php
define('WP_DEBUG', true);
define('WP_DEBUG_LOG', true);
define('WP_DEBUG_DISPLAY', false);
```

**Reference:** [`themes/travel-concierge-me-theme/docs/where_to_see_logs.md`](themes/travel-concierge-me-theme/docs/where_to_see_logs.md)

### Common Issues

| Problem | Check | Solution |
|---------|-------|----------|
| Endpoint returns 404 | Registration, permalinks | Flush permalinks, verify `register_routes()` |
| Nonce validation fails (403) | Nonce freshness, header name | Get new nonce, use `X-WP-Nonce` |
| Session not found | TTL, UUID format | Check expiration (10 min), verify UUID |
| TBO API error | Env vars, credentials | Verify `.env`, test with TBO Authenticate |

